# Payment Platform on AWS EKS

## Project Overview

This project implements a containerised Spring Boot payment platform deployed on Amazon EKS using a GitOps-based deployment model.

The platform was designed to demonstrate a production-style Kubernetes architecture covering:

- Infrastructure provisioning on AWS
- Kubernetes workload deployment
- GitOps-based continuous delivery
- Application and infrastructure metrics
- Centralised Kubernetes logging
- OpenTelemetry-based telemetry collection
- Grafana-based observability

The application and observability components are managed declaratively using Kubernetes manifests, Helm charts, and Argo CD.

---

